  "name": "Question 4",
  "problem": "Simplify $\\frac{{c}^{-4}}{{c}^{-1}}.$",
  "worked_solution": "We subtract the exponents, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{c}^{-4}}{{c}^{-1}} & = \\\\ {c}^{-4-(-1)} & = \\\\ {c}^{-4+1} & = \\\\ {c}^{-3} & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
